A nightly data load

The `Scheduler` starts the `Extract job`. The `Extract job` reads the
`Sales database` and writes files to the `Data lake`. The `Load job` reads the
`Data lake` and writes to the `Warehouse`. The `Dashboard` reads the
`Warehouse`.
---
Scheduler -> Extract job: start
Extract job -> Sales database: read
Extract job -> Data lake: write
Load job -> Data lake: read
Load job -> Warehouse: write
Dashboard -> Warehouse: read
